| theDotNetWay | 1 | 1.05 | 1.07 | 0/10 | 1.09 |
| theDotNetWay | 2 | 1.05 | 1.06 | 0/10 | 1.07 |
| theDotNetWay | 3 | 1.08 | 1.06 | 0/10 | 1.08 |

